# discovery

Java/JS/PHP project scanners plus shared port-file helpers.

| Type | Entry | Port files |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Spring | `java/ProjectScanner`, `java/PortExtractor` | `DeclaredPortFiles.springConfigFiles()` — `server.port` in `.properties` / YAML |
| JS | `js/JsProjectScanner`, `DevServerPortDetector` | vite config, `.env`, `package.json` |
| PHP | `php/PhpProjectScanner` | `.env`, compose files |

`DeclaredPortFiles.preferred` is the file to open in the editor. `PortExtractor.locate` returns the first of those files that actually declares a port.
`ConfigText.stripQuotes` is the shared quote stripper for `.env` / YAML port values.
